{"seq":71,"slug":"software-metrics-code-quality","title":"软件度量与代码质量","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-metrics-code-quality","rating":{"composite":3.74,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"软件度量与代码质量\">软件度量与代码质量</h1><p>把代码质量当成一件可以「说清楚、量出来、管得住」的事情，是这个 hub 想要传达的核心主张。很多团队凭直觉判断一段代码好不好，争论时各执一词，最后谁嗓门大谁赢——这恰恰是因为他们手里没有共享的语言和共享的数字。度量的价值，不在于把工程师变成 KPI 流水线上的工人，而在于把模糊的「这代码太烂了」翻译成「这个函数的认知复杂度是 38，远超阈值 15，三个月内被改过 11 次」这样可讨论、可对比、可追踪的事实。</p>\n<p>但度量本身是一把双刃剑。一旦某个数字变成考核目标，它就会被人想方设法做漂亮，而代码的真实质量反而原地踏步甚至倒退。这就是为什么这个 hub 不是一份「指标清单」，而是一条有逻辑次序的认知路径：先想清楚质量到底是什么、度量为什么容易失效，再去学具体怎么量，最后才谈怎么把这些数字嵌进日常工程流程里持续治理。</p>\n<p>四个章节层层递进。第一章「基础」打地基：定义什么是代码质量、揭示度量的陷阱（古德哈特定律是贯穿全 hub 的暗线），并给出建立度量体系的方法论，让后面所有具体指标都站在正确的认识论之上。第二章「代码度量」深入三类最核心的静态指标——复杂度、耦合内聚、规模与重复——这是直接作用于源码本身的「显微镜」。第三章「分析手段」转向如何主动发现质量问题：静态分析工具、测试覆盖率、人工代码评审，三者互为补充，机器抓机械错误、人抓意图偏差。第四章「治理」把视角拉到工程组织层面：技术债务如何量化和偿还、质量门禁如何在 CI 里自动把关、质量趋势如何长期监控，让质量不再是某次突击整改，而是持续演进的工程纪律。</p>\n<p>读完这个 hub，你应该既能在代码评审里指出「这里耦合过紧」并用数字佐证，也能在团队会议上反驳「我们应该把覆盖率目标定到 100%」这种看似正确实则有害的提议。度量是手段，工程师对质量的判断力才是目的。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-metrics-code-quality/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-quality","title":"什么是代码质量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-metrics-code-quality/foundations/what-is-quality"},{"seq":2,"slug":"metrics-pitfalls","title":"度量的陷阱与古德哈特定律","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-metrics-code-quality/foundations/metrics-pitfalls"},{"seq":3,"slug":"measurement-program","title":"建立度量体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-metrics-code-quality/foundations/measurement-program"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"code-metrics","title":"代码度量","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-metrics-code-quality/code-metrics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"complexity-metrics","title":"复杂度度量：圈复杂度与认知复杂度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-metrics-code-quality/code-metrics/complexity-metrics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"coupling-cohesion","title":"耦合与内聚度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-metrics-code-quality/code-metrics/coupling-cohesion"},{"seq":3,"slug":"size-duplication","title":"规模与重复度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-metrics-code-quality/code-metrics/size-duplication"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"analysis","title":"分析手段","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-metrics-code-quality/analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"static-analysis","title":"静态分析与代码检查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-metrics-code-quality/analysis/static-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"test-coverage","title":"测试覆盖率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-metrics-code-quality/analysis/test-coverage"},{"seq":3,"slug":"code-review-quality","title":"代码评审与质量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-metrics-code-quality/analysis/code-review-quality"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"management","title":"治理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-metrics-code-quality/management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"technical-debt","title":"技术债务管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-metrics-code-quality/management/technical-debt"},{"seq":2,"slug":"quality-gates","title":"质量门禁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-metrics-code-quality/management/quality-gates"},{"seq":3,"slug":"trend-monitoring","title":"质量趋势监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-metrics-code-quality/management/trend-monitoring"}]}]}